names_batch.py and _names_edit_dialog.py adapt these Apache-2.0 fontlab-samples
from the retained archive (_old/part4/fontlab-samples/samples/):
names_batch_rename.py, names_duplicate_unicodes.py, names_glyph_notes.py,
names_glyph_tags.py, names_mark_color_palette.py, names_suffix_tool.py and
