Scriptmix migration.json appends seven original/destination SHA-256 pairs.
Every archived input and the previous41menu bytes/mapping rows stay unchanged.
See LICENSE (Scriptmix) or LICENSE-APACHE-2.0 (App). Native acceptance is pending.
